# Frontend architecture rules

Follow `CLAUDE.md` as the source of truth.

Hard rules:
- Feature-based architecture; no empty placeholder folders
- TypeScript only in `src/` (no `.js`/`.jsx`)
- No explicit `any`
- kebab-case filenames
- `@/` path aliases
- Add shadcn components via CLI only
- Server state → TanStack Query; URL state → nuqs; forms → RHF + Zod
- Routes only via `ROUTES` helpers in `src/constants/routes.ts`
- Env only via `src/lib/env.ts`
- Do not add Redux/Zustand/Jotai without demonstrated need
- Do not weaken lint/type rules
